 "integration": {
  "summary": "Set the BMS protocol, instance, baud and MAC in the controller's BMS Config screens. Enable the unit with BV 1, write the discharge air setpoints and pressure setpoints, and optionally share outdoor temperature and humidity. Monitor supply fan status, discharge temperature, safety status and the general alarm relay.",
